<!--
    ProgressValueBar - progress bar skins in the look of the ValueBarComponent (enemy energy bars).
    Texture: ProgressValueBar.png (128 x 32), put it next to MyGUI_BlackBlueSkins.png.

    Skins (the 'Skin' attribute of a MyGUIProgressBarComponent):
      ProgressValueBar         frame + dark background + red fill. Drop in replacement for ProgressBarFill.
      ProgressValueBarTrail    frame + dark background + light damage trail fill.
      ProgressValueBarOverlay  red fill only, no frame and no background. Laid exactly over a
                               ProgressValueBarTrail bar, the trail shows through where energy was just lost.

    The fill color comes from the texture: region 32..55 is the red fill, 64..87 the trail. Recolor
    those two regions for other bars (e.g. blue for mana, green for experience).
-->
